"turn_index":29,"usage":null},{"content":"I have changed the network mode preference to 4G/5G preferred. Now the status bar shows excellent signal strength, the network type is 5G, and mobile data is enabled. However, my messaging app still cannot send MMS messages. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:08.144159","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":30,"usage":{"completion_tokens":31,"prompt_tokens":3129}},{"content":"Signal and network type are now fine. Next, please run **check_apn_settings** and tell me the APN name and whether an MMSC URL is set.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:09.257963","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":31,"usage":{"completion_tokens":48,"prompt_tokens":13024}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:10.542098","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_ThmjmBwuAB7FGT1GflHiRPgo","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":32,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3167}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): Not Set\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":33,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:10.542427","tool_call_id":"call_ThmjmBwuAB7FGT1GflHiRPgo","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":33,"usage":null},{"content":"The current APN name on my phone is \"internet,\" but there is no MMSC URL set for picture messages. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":34,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:11.601176","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":34,"usage":{"completion_tokens":32,"prompt_tokens":3216}},{"content":"The MMSC URL isn't set, and MMS can't work without it. Please do the following:\n\n1. Use **reset_apn_settings** to reset the APN settings to default.\n2. Then use **reboot_device** to restart the phone. The reset doesn't take effect until you reboot.\n\nAfter the phone restarts, run **check_apn_settings** to confirm an MMSC URL is now set. Then run **can_send_mms** and tell me whether it works.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":35,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:13.149183","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":35,"usage":{"completion_tokens":146,"prompt_tokens":13111}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":36,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:14.272986","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_MqUm65Ca3iS7erlfEAEBirs1","name":"reset_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_nAOGnHv0pqdvQ7PIJGBnvWdw","name":"reboot_device","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":36,"usage":{"completion_tokens":43,"prompt_tokens":3352}},{"content":"APN settings will reset at reboot.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":37,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-21T01:03:14.273214","tool_call_id":"call_MqUm65Ca3iS7erlfEAEBirs1","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":37,